### 좋아요 등록
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/products/1/likes
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Id: 1

###

### 좋아요 취소
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/v1/products/1/likes
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Id: 1

###

### 상품 조회 (좋아요 수 포함)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/products/1
Content-Type: application/json

###

### 상품 목록 조회 (좋아요 순 정렬)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/products?sort=LIKE_COUNT_DESC&page=0&size=10
Content-Type: application/json

###
